Short:        Shared graphics library.  includes source.
Author:       luke@raj2.tn.cornell.edu (Luke Emmert)
Uploader:     luke raj2 tn cornell edu (Luke Emmert)
Type:         dev/src
Requires:     EGS
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

  This is an almost complete alternative to both the graphics and
layers libraries.  It uses EGS as an RTG layer, but with your own
compiler this could easily be changed.
